{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/856b54d2e4c7965a74d0100b0ca041b7.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/65173e166b9d492529af2a808192fe9d.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/65173e166b9d492529af2a808192fe9d.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/65173e166b9d492529af2a808192fe9d.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are a <i><strong>liquid-simulated slime</strong></i> where <strong>every move costs you a piece of yourself</strong>. To reach The Melty Way, you must master slime physics and constantly rebalance your mass, sacrificing resilience for agility and back again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/ae6c5abc31fb2f31711ef52ad94c8c98.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/b1756cfd1c14d249847eb652b37466fa.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/b1756cfd1c14d249847eb652b37466fa.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/b1756cfd1c14d249847eb652b37466fa.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Your body is your only resource.</strong> Every pixel you move is a pixel left behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/157dc3cd5d36a4b5cd8496f1b861c679.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/1bdbfa70fab3acc4c53c80c30199f27f.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/1bdbfa70fab3acc4c53c80c30199f27f.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/1bdbfa70fab3acc4c53c80c30199f27f.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shrink</strong> to squeeze through tight tunnels and gain explosive speed to clear impossible gaps.<br><strong>Grow</strong> to gain the weight needed to manipulate the environment and survive punishing hazards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/af8ee9a39da4b44ca7d1b231c7a6a7d1.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/15d8983da52e9c515bdc6db1f24abc3e.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/15d8983da52e9c515bdc6db1f24abc3e.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/15d8983da52e9c515bdc6db1f24abc3e.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Masocore</strong> challenges where success means \u201c<strong>Mastering the Melt</strong>\u201d and executing pixel-perfect precision across levels designed to push your reflexes, AND your mind, to the limit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5b5340a368417b862a7e5786e3a81e16.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5af31f958d1e34bebbcb6e314d2c356f.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5af31f958d1e34bebbcb6e314d2c356f.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/5af31f958d1e34bebbcb6e314d2c356f.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Discover new mechanics</strong> on your journey that <strong>reshape</strong> how each trial is overcome. From movement to environmental interactions, every biome introduces new challenges to master. Progress is only made through <strong>mastery</strong> of every new system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/de95dfe18c12c3c1347677abadc4bde2.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/297d10a275b55c3a45d7a72ac0db3b5c.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/297d10a275b55c3a45d7a72ac0db3b5c.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/297d10a275b55c3a45d7a72ac0db3b5c.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Intelligent interactions shape every level and hasty decisions can have disastrous consequences. Objects and hazards react dynamically to your actions, forcing you to observe, experiment, and adapt. Success comes from assessing the situation and using your big beautiful brain to stay alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/208592961e2fe83aa7157f4791146fa6.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1560 height=199 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/10a0db9aac8938662838f8a98633cae8.poster.avif?t=1772138521\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/extras/10a0db9aac8938662838f8a98633cae8.webm?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/webm; c