97c438e9646085a836fecb04f4f.mp4?t=1772138521\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your survival doesn\u2019t have to be colorless. Uncover secret paths and hidden challenges to unlock unique slime colors and skins. Prove your mastery by reclaiming your form in style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["G Doubl\u00e9"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990570/16447566c605276d944c35c068005af8f78de379/header.jpg?t=1772138521","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 G Doubl\u00e9. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+ compatible GPU (1GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Tested on SteamOS / Proton</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 LTS (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU with 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> None<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Tested on SteamOS / Proton, SSD reco